WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:02.490
Speaker 1: So this is very interesting.

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:09.080
We have resolution in some sense to one of
the many election lie related lawsuits that

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.080
are taking place.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.969
It's important to follow these stories to
their conclusions.

00:00:13.969 --> 00:00:21.980
Newsmax is one of the right wing media networks
that was spreading known, demonstrable, debunked

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:27.040
lies about the twenty twenty election in the
months after the November election.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:34.370
One of the targets of these lies was Dominion
Voting Systems, which attracted the ire of

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:41.100
Fox News, Newsmax, Rudy Giuliani, Sydney Powell,
the My Pillow guy.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:47.360
Many people going bonkers about Dominion voting
system supposed role in helping to steal the

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.170
election for Donald Trump, from Donald Trump.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.480
For Joe Biden.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:59.420
Newsmax specifically made such claims as Eric
Coomber, an executive at Dominion, was supposedly

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:04.850
part of an Antifa conference call to rig the
election.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:10.290
There were also other claims about exactly
how Dominion voting systems stole votes from

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.750
Trump and gave them to Biden.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.310
There's no evidence for any of this stuff.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.460
There never was.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:20.200
So Dominion voting systems decided to sort
of try to throw the book at.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.490
These people sued Newsmax.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:29.060
Among others, and the Newsmax lawsuit has
now been settled, this is the first such settlement.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.590
We don't know the financial terms of the settlement,
but presumably there is a financial payoff

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.409
here by Newsmax.

00:01:35.409 --> 00:01:42.729
And of course, we are led to believe that
this is only the first of many, but this is

00:01:42.729 --> 00:01:45.920
just the best tail between the legs outcome.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.260
Newsmax has published an apology.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:54.220
Now, the apology is sort of B.S., but it's
still interesting to look at.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:02:02.520
First of all, they published it with the completely
anodyne title statement about Dr. Eric Coomer,

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:06.030
director of product strategy and security
at Dominion Voting Systems.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.030
OK, so let's look at this.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.349
This is the retraction and apology.

00:02:09.349 --> 00:02:13.800
Newsmax says since Election Day, various guests,
attorneys and hosts on Newsmax have offered

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.660
opinions and claims about Dr. Eric Kumah Newsmax.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:22.319
We'd like to clarify its coverage of Dr. Coomber
and note that while Newsmax initially covered

00:02:22.319 --> 00:02:27.550
claims by President Trump's lawyers, supporters
and others that Dr. Coomber played a role

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:31.819
in manipulating, manipulating Dominion voting
machines, Dominion voting software and the

00:02:31.819 --> 00:02:36.750
final vote counts in the twenty election,
Newsmax subsequently found no evidence that

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.410
such allegations were true.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:39.680
So already they're framing it.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:44.880
As we were bystanders here, we did nothing.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.640
There were people who came on and made claims.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:52.800
When we looked into the truth of the claims,
we found no evidence for them.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:03:00.000
Now, this is a very sort of cynical view on
the role of Newsmax.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.230
They knew from day one that there was no evidence,
but they continue to allow the claims to be

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.230
made.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:10.849
So even the framing of the apologies is pretty
much B.S. Newsmax going on to say many of

00:03:10.849 --> 00:03:15.150
the states whose results were contested by
the Trump campaign have conducted recounts

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:19.180
and audits and each state certified the results
is legal and final.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.350
There are several facts our viewers should
be aware of.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.350
This is great news.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:26.380
Max has found no evidence that Dr. Coomber
interfered with Dominion voting machines or

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:31.190
voting software in any way, nor that Dr. Coomber
ever claimed to have done so.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:35.569
Nor has Newsmax found any evidence that Dr.
Coomber ever participated in any conversation

00:03:35.569 --> 00:03:41.450
with members of Antifa, nor that he was directly
involved with any partizan political organization

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.690
on behalf of Newsmax.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:47.280
We would like to apologize for any harm our
reporting of the allegations against Coomber

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.750
may have caused to Dr. Coomber and his family.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.790
For more, go to our website and read facts
about Dominion now.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:04:00.090
I love that they did this, but this is one
of the most B.S. apologies and retractions

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.090
I've seen.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:05.629
Because, I mean, listen, first of all, in
general, with these apologies and retractions,

00:04:05.629 --> 00:04:12.640
they did months of the coverage and now almost
no one is going to hear or value this apology,

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.709
which is so narrow in scope.

00:04:14.709 --> 00:04:21.349
Understand that they're not even retracting
general claims made about dominion.

00:04:21.349 --> 00:04:29.879
All they are saying is the specific claims
guests made about Dr. Koumas role are without

00:04:29.879 --> 00:04:30.879
evidence.

00:04:30.879 --> 00:04:36.580
A lot of the claims were more broad about
Dominion voting systems as an as an entity,

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.259
as an organization.

00:04:38.259 --> 00:04:41.990
They're not even retracting or apologizing
about that.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.830
Nevermind all of this other stuff.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:48.460
Claims from Sydney Powell and Mike Pelo about
Venezuela, Hugo Chavez, whatever.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.550
OK, so listen up.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:55.909
Presumably Newsmax decided to settle to avoid
going forward because it would cost them a

00:04:55.909 --> 00:04:57.779
lot more money.

00:04:57.779 --> 00:04:59.009
There's a risk for Dominion.

00:04:59.009 --> 00:05:04.839
Also, if the lawsuit were to move forward
and go to court, maybe Dominion doesn't win

00:05:04.839 --> 00:05:06.250
the defamation suit.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.250
Who knows?

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.789
Both parties decided it was in their interest
to settle.

00:05:09.789 --> 00:05:16.370
But I received some emails from people saying,
you know, the apology is so narrow and such

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.430
B.S. that no one will see.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:25.029
It might be more impactful if one of these
lawsuits really lead to the complete and total

00:05:25.029 --> 00:05:28.069
demise of an organization like Newsmax.

00:05:28.069 --> 00:05:31.300
I can see both sides because there are risks
to going to trial.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.629
I'm sure both sides accounted for those risks
in making their decision to settle.

00:05:34.629 --> 00:05:42.270
Now, in terms of what Newsmax really believes
as an entity, it is obvious Newsmax never

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:43.270
believe this stuff.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:44.580
Ever, ever, ever.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:51.550
They are the there are people taking the position
that Newsmax is saying this now only because

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.449
they have to, but they still believe the election
was stolen.

00:05:54.449 --> 00:05:55.979
No, no, no, no, no.

00:05:55.979 --> 00:05:59.360
Maybe there are some hosts individually that
believe the election was stolen.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:04.029
I think the reality is Newsmax as an entity
never believed this.

00:06:04.029 --> 00:06:08.110
They were going with it and allowing guests
to push it for clicks.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.110
That's all it was.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.310
I don't think there was any point at which
Newsmax had an editorial position that this

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.550
election was stolen by Joe Biden.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:16.210
This is now one settlement.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.210
We will see what more comes of it.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:17.218
There are many more of these in play

